# Apex Scaffold - Podman 构建上下文忽略清单
# 不排除 pom.xml / src / .mvn（构建必需）。
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
.DS_Store
# 默认忽略全部构建产物；prebuilt 模式（--build-arg BUILD_MODE=prebuilt）需要
# 复用宿主已构建的 fat jar，因此放行各运行模块的 target 目录（见文件末尾）。
**/target
**/classes
logs
data
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config/license/private.key
config/license/*.lic
backups
lr
.workbuddy
node_modules
k8s
.containerignore

# prebuilt 模式复用宿主构建产物：先放行目录，再放行 fat jar（gitignore 语义下
# 父目录被排除时，子项的 ! 放行不生效）。第二阶段起叶子嵌套于分组父目录，
# 运行模块统一位于 apex-services-bom/ 之下。
!apex-services-bom/apex-gateway/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-system-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-auth-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-workflow-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-office-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-file-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-integration-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-aggregation-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-job-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-masking-service/target/
!apex-services-bom/apex-knowledge-service/target/
